Package: sisura-audit
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: @SISURA_ARCH@
Maintainer: The Sisura Authors <ahmetatakan.tech@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, sisura-hardening, dpkg, iproute2, util-linux, mount, kmod, nftables, ufw, apt, systemd
Description: Check that a Sisura system's hardening is still in place
 sisura-audit compares the running system with the hardening of the
 installed Sisura packages: kernel settings, SSH, firewall, AppArmor,
 setuid programs, accounts, sudo, PAM, kernel modules, automatic updates,
 the Sisura apt repository, boot settings, disk encryption and Secure Boot.
 It reports what was changed and, where it can, which file changed it.
 .
 Run: sudo sisura-audit   (--json for tools, --quiet for problems only)
